{"brief":"The user enjoys comedy because it makes them laugh and usually does not require a sensible plot. They described one comedy they enjoy as funny overall, but its title was inaudible and remains unknown.

They have seen Stepbrothers and liked the combination of its lead actors, Will Ferrell and the other lead, whose name they could not recall. They specifically cited this pairing as their reason for liking the movie.

They dislike drama because they feel they already have enough drama in their own life and do not enjoy thinking about other people’s problems. They mentioned clichéd problems in dramas, although their qualification involving “not superficial” was unclear. They could not think of a specific movie they strongly disliked at the time."}
